 <div class="w split">
  <div>
   <h2>About the department</h2>
   <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:0">Established to foster scientific curiosity and rigorous empirical inquiry, the Department of Physics at Anandaram Dhekial Phookan College provides comprehensive undergraduate education blending classical mechanics, quantum theory, electrodynamics, and hands-on laboratory experimentation.</p>
   <ul class="facts">
    <li>Programme: B.Sc. Physics (Honours and General)</li>
    <li>Affiliated to Gauhati University</li>
    <li>Location: Haiborgaon, Nagaon, Assam</li>
   </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="ph"><img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDImVdjZALq-SbEuFx85juSn2aNvYheEUtyvtqZd4IsmUR996ti5rjiMz2R0MWQDpF6TH1USawdsAG6dTZCLkYidnjYYmvKLuNh8xsEqHsVJJ-UeQgmfTp3rBi9XvzwhWVRXwXMJaWid2bNd4uFr86UE6KnxSw5jKekqoHKsDIQlxE9bcZnuIgpk2T3llJaFwZY5-kkZ7QYwnyGyPU6uLxv2AT_bTERbuhRS4YOPNbfJ6geWvv9NymlIQ" alt="Department corridor and verandah at ADP College" loading="lazy"></div>
 </div>
</section>
<section id="labs" class="labs">
 <div class="w">
  <h2>Laboratories and experiments</h2>
  <p class="lead">Students learn by measuring. Equipped with apparatus for hands-on experimentation across classical and modern physics.</p>
  <div class="grid">
   <div class="card"><h3>Heat and thermodynamics</h3><p>Thermal conductivity by Searle's method, Lee's and Chorlton's disc, and specific heat experiments.</p></div>
   <div class="card"><h3>Electricity and magnetism</h3><p>B-H curve and hysteresis loss, bridge circuits, and measurement with galvanometers.</p></div>
   <div class="card"><h3>Solid state</h3><p>Hall effect in semiconductors, four-probe resistivity and band gap measurement.</p></div>
   <div class="card dark"><h3>Optics</h3><p>Interference, diffraction, polarisation and spectrometer work.</p></div>
   <div class="card dark"><h3>Electronics</h3><p>Diodes, transistors, amplifiers, logic gates and the oscilloscope.</p></div>
   <div class="card dark"><h3>Computational physics</h3><p>Simple programs for data analysis, plotting and numerical solutions.</p></div>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>
